OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 22, appears in court charged
OL,4,Awith murder of 80-year-old
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has appeared in court charged
OL,7,Fwith the murder of an 80-year-old man
OL,8,Fin Fife.
OL,10,FWilliam MacAllister, 22, is accused of
OL,11,Fkilling James Suttie during a
OL,12,Fdisturbance in Glenrothes on 31
OL,13,FOctober.
OL,15,FEmergency crews were called to the
OL,16,Fscene at Dunecht Court, but Suttie was
OL,17,Fpronounced dead a short time later.
OL,19,FMacAllister made no plea during an
OL,20,Finitial appearance at Kirkcaldy Sheriff
OL,21,FCourt. He was remanded in custody and
OL,22,Fis due to appear again at a later date.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
